# Vendor binder service contexts for vndservicemanager.
#
# AOSP's vendor/vndservice_contexts already provides the `*` default entry;
# only the device-specific vendor namespace services are labelled here.
#
# oppoalgo_daemon (init.mt6765.rc, started on sys.boot_completed=1) registers
# android.OPPO.IOppoAlgoDaemon. The binary links libbinder, not
# libhidltransport/libhwbinder, so this is a vndservice_contexts entry, not a
# hwservice_contexts one. The stock 8.1 policy labels the same name with
# oppoalgo_service; device.te declares the type and its service_manager rules.
android.OPPO.IOppoAlgoDaemon	u:object_r:oppoalgo_service:s0
